# TODO.md §1, "A Codex file-change approval joins its diff"
#
# docs/NATIVE-AGENTS.md §6.2 — "For an edit approval Fleet shows what t3code cannot: **the
#   diff**, joined by `itemId` and rendered by `DiffView` at bounded height"
#
# The gate carries the normalized item id, the card copy names `README.md`, and
# `AgentThreadView::decision_diff` joins only that item's diff. The additive decision projection
# proves the drawer rendered that exact join rather than merely opening an approval.
fixture: agents
await idle
key o
await screen == Workspace 20000

key ctrl-s A
await agents.threads[0].provider == codex 20000
assert focused == agents.composer
await idle 30000
type apply the README fix
key enter

await agents.threads[0].pending_gate == permission 30000
assert key_contexts[2] == AgentPermission
shot approval

# The assertion this file exists for.
assert agents.decision.kind == approval && agents.decision.item exists && agents.decision.diff == true
dump approval-with-diff
quit
